WEBVTT

00:03:29.436 --> 00:03:33.876
The remaining 26 percent
is used for pasture,

00:03:33.916 --> 00:03:37.636
mostly for cattle, sheep and goats.

00:03:38.516 --> 00:03:44.356
Our environmental crisis
is not driven by intensive farming

00:03:44.396 --> 00:03:46.876
or by extensive farming,

00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:50.636
but by a disastrous
combination of the two.

00:03:51.356 --> 00:03:53.556
The problem is not the adjective --

00:03:54.276 --> 00:03:55.436
it's the noun.

00:03:57.196 --> 00:03:59.356
Farming itself is threatened

00:03:59.396 --> 00:04:03.316
by the environmental harm
that it's contributed to,